// Painted arena backgrounds (floor, walls and surroundings in one image),
// drawn over the whole 640x360 arena. Indexed by arena; arenas without one
// are drawn from tiles and code. Sources in assets/arenas/:
//   stadium-native.png    in use: stadium.png brought back onto its own pixel
//                         grid (416x238, every colour kept), drawn unsmoothed
//   stadium-pixellab.png  PixelLab Pro's redraw from stadium.png (fewer colours)
//   stadium.png           the user's painting with its baked spotlights removed
//   stadium-original.png  the painting as supplied
//   crater-pixel-src.png  in use: crater-original.png redrawn as clean pixel
//                         art by PixelLab Pro Flash (255x147), fitted to the
//                         arena with hard pixel edges
//   crater.png            the painting fitted at 1280x720 (detailed but grainy)
//   ruins-full.webp in use: the same fit at the painting's own resolution
//                         (no resampling, WebP q98), drawn on the screen-resolution layer
//   ruins-hd.webp         earlier (Ruins): ruins-original.webp at 1280x720
//                         (Lanczos, 1.1x the full-frame fit so the courtyard
//                         covers the floor at the fighters' scale); smoothed
//   ruins-original.webp   the painting as supplied
//   lab-full.webp in use: the same fit at the painting's own resolution
//                         (no resampling, WebP q98), drawn on the screen-resolution layer
//   lab-hd.webp           earlier (Power Plant): lab-original.webp at 1280x720
//                         (Lanczos, 0.44 arena px per source px, as Caldera),
//                         so the lab floor covers the arena floor; smoothed
//   lab-original.webp     the painting as supplied
//   magma-full.webp in use: the same fit at the painting's own resolution
//                         (no resampling, WebP q98), drawn on the screen-resolution layer
//   magma-hd.webp         earlier (Magma Isle): magma-original.webp at 1280x720
//                         (Lanczos, the full frame), moved down 23px to fit
//                         the floor, the top band mirrored; drawn smoothed
//   magma-original.webp   the painting as supplied
//   magma-old-native.png  the earlier Magma Isle on its 4px grid (320x208)
//   magma-old-original.webp  that painting as supplied
//   shrine-pixel.png      in use (Sunken Shrine): PixelLab Pro Flash's redraw
//                         of shrine-original.webp as clean pixel art
//                         (shrine-pixel-src.png, 275x152, 16 colours), moved
//                         down 10 rows to fit the floor, back wall mirrored
//   shrine-native.png     the painting on its own 4px grid (384x216)
//   shrine-original.webp  the painting as supplied
//   caldera-full.webp in use: the same fit at the painting's own resolution
//                         (no resampling, WebP q98), drawn on the screen-resolution layer
//   caldera-hd.webp       earlier (Ember Caldera): caldera-original.webp at the
//                         game canvas's own size (1280x720, Lanczos), fitted
//                         so the plateau covers the floor; drawn smoothed
//   caldera-native.png    the same fit on the painting's 4px grid (357x202)
//   caldera-original.webp the painting as supplied
